  m_text: "1. Your goal is to collect all items on the grocery list at the bottom
    of your screen.\n2. Talk to people in the store to find information about the
    items.\n3. Once you think you have the right item, place it in the basket located
    next to the front door. \n4. If it is correct, the item number will lower, if
    it is incorrect, you lose a life.\nCollect everything before losing all your
    lives!"
